Package: QAL
Type: Package
Title: Quantile Adaptive Lasso for Quantile Treatment Effects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yahang", "Liu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "yhliu22@m.fudan.edu.cn")
Description: Selects covariates in binary propensity score models using
    quantile-regression adaptive penalty weights and weighted absolute mean
    difference tuning. Estimates marginal quantile treatment effects with
    inverse-probability-weighted quantile regression following Liu et al.
    (2025) <doi:10.1080/00949655.2024.2424348>.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: lqa, quantreg, stats
